// Self tests for CK3xBL.Mapping: golden values from the reference JS resolvers (tools/data/mapping_resolver.js,
// tools/data/battlefield_resolver.js, generated by running them on bridge/data), whole-table integrity checks, and six
// hand-built battles with request and outcome invariants. The mapping polish (restricted troops, scene vegetation) and the
// battle clock (PROTOCOL §14: payload 4 outcomes, reinforcement clashes) are at the end. The knights pass and the presentation
// flags are in MappingTests.Knights.cs.
// Run: dotnet run --project CK3xBL.SelfTest -- mapping
